; MARK: 3-10: 💬 ゲストハウスの秘密
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論3-10 ゲストハウスの秘密
; カットイン
; BGM変更：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@SetBadId CommonBadEndId:4

# Judge3-10-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あの部屋には何か<br>特別な仕掛けがあったのは<br>間違いないよ……！|#0103Trial10_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でも……<br>そんなん、<br>何も見つかってねーぞ。|#0103Trial10_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……私は<br>桜羽エマの意見に<br>賛成よ。<br>そうでないと、<br>密室に説明が<br>つかないもの。|#0103Trial10_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"あるとすれば……<br>やっぱり<link=\"Objection_01_03_10_01\">隠し通路</link><br>でしょうか？<br>どこかに<br>繋がっているのかも<br>しれません！|#0103Trial10_Sherry001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんな大掛かりな<br>仕掛け……<br>本当に<br>ありえるんで<br>しょうか……？|#0103Trial10_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"もっと簡単な仕掛けって<br>いうのなら……<br>実は扉の<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_02\">鍵の開閉</link>が<br>操作できたとか……<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_03\">スペアキー</link>が<br>あったとかかしら。|#0103Trial10_Nanoka002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"他には、<br>部屋の一部が<br>透明になったり……<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_04\">視覚を誤魔化す</link>ような<br>仕掛けがあったとかはどう？<br>鏡とか……<br>屈折レンズの仕掛けとかね。|#0103Trial10_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……そんなん言い出したら、<br>もうなんでもありじゃん！<br>だったらもういっそ<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_05\">ワープ装置</link>でも<br>あったって事にする！？<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_06\">入れ替わった</link>りするヤツ！|#0103Trial10_Coco001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:32,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"まあそこまでは<br>いかなくても……<br>あの建物自体、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_10_07\">解体</link>が可能だった<br>とかはどうだ？<br>簡単に全部バラせるなら、<br>密室なんて関係ねーだろ。|#0103Trial10_Alisa002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


